Package: ooexpand
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign POSIX tab expander, whitespace visualizer, and indentation auditor in pure openOODA.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 custom tab-stop lists, initial indentation conversion, tab visualization,
 whitespace hygiene auditing, and streaming Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
